{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Echo Show 8 fits my Fire TV and Alexa setup while adding a screen and video calling, giving me a useful new function.",
    "The Alexa smart plug feels like a natural next step because controlling a lamp would extend my connected-home setup. Camera recommendations also reflect my interest in home monitoring."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Another HD Fire TV Stick adds little because I already have a 4K stick and a Fire TV television. Likewise, I would try my recently purchased Blink before adding another camera system.",
    "The tablet, car Alexa device, and charging cables do not address a current need. Sharing a brand or connecting to electronics I might own is not enough to make me choose them."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in Fire TV seems to have been stretched into interest in Amazon devices for any setting, including tablets and car accessories.",
    "My camera and streaming purchases seem to be treated as reasons to buy more similar devices, even when those purchases may already cover the need."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "Recent purchases affect what I need next: I want time to use the Blink, and another streaming stick offers little beyond what I already have.",
    "I prefer a useful addition with a clear purpose, such as the Show 8 or a smart plug. I would choose one display, and I would confirm my camcorder's storage requirements before buying a memory card."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my connected-home interests but sometimes confuse adding a useful capability with buying another related device."
}"}
